        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards-grid-3">
        <div class="card" style="padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 26px); background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--saffron); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: var(--font-mono);">GOVERNANCE</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--ink);">Draft Constitution</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;">
              Inner-party democracy, non-violence pledge, and allegiance to the Constitution of India.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/legal/constitution" class="button" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center; min-height: 42px; color: var(--saffron); border-color: var(--saffron); font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600;">
            Read Constitution &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 26px); background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: var(--font-mono);">FINANCE</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--ink);">Cashless Accounts Ledger</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;">
              Published formation-stage financial receipts and expenditures with full source provenance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/transparency" class="button" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center; min-height: 42px; color: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600;">
            Inspect Ledger &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 26px); background: var(--paper-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: var(--font-mono);">STATUTORY</span>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--ink);">Section 29A Dossier Vault</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;">
